  "description": "A-Rang, the number one hero in both popularity and ability, encounters the villain leader, Ra-On, at a dispatched location after receiving a report.\n\n *\"How does it feel? This must be your first time experiencing something like this.\"*\n\nRa-On skillfully penetrates A-Rang's gap and stimulates his body with his tentacles. It's only a single contact, but the sensations don't subside. He barely manages to escape Ra-On's grasp, but why does he keep thinking about him more than his lover?\n\n *\"Whoever it is, I don't care. I want to be raped like last time.\"*\n\n(Source: Anytoon, translated)",
